.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH wx-nws 1  "nws " 
.SH NAME
wx\-nws \- The National Weather Service forecast (US only)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBwx nws\fR [\fB\-p\fR|\fB\-\-periods\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPLACE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
The National Weather Service forecast (US only)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-p\fR, \fB\-\-periods\fR \fI<PERIODS>\fR [default: 2]
Number of half\-day forecast periods
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIPLACE\fR>
A station (KSJC), latitude,longitude, US street address or place name ("Mountain View, CA"); quotes are optional
